  "description": "Official .NET SDK for the Crypto Chief crypto processing API — a unified crypto payment gateway for accepting crypto payments, sending payouts (single & mass), signing on-chain transactions (incl. EVM/TRON/Solana/TON contract calls without hand-encoded calldata), managing wallets, and verifying webhooks across 25+ blockchains (Ethereum, Tron, TON, Solana, Bitcoin and more).",
